B.Wz=new A.v("feature_ward_Safety","Safety","While Concentrating, the target gains advantage on defenses from Opportunity Attacks. The Target of your Ward Reaction gains advantage on defenses from Opportunity Attacks until the end of their turn.")
B.aay=s([B.Ul,B.Tj,B.Wz],t.U)
B.ZB=new A.ap("feature_ward","Ward","[Action] Target yourself or an Ally range 4 and begin concentrating. While concentrating, at the start of the target\u2019s turn make a Status Check vs Wis. On Success, the target gains {Source d6} shield, and push all enemies adjacent to the target {half Source} spaces away from the target.\n\n[Reaction] At the start of your or an ally\u2019s turn, Make a status check vs Wis. On Success, give the Target {Source d6} shield, and push enemies adjacent to the target {half Source} Spaces away from the target.\n",B.aA,B.aay,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Sc=new A.v("feature_wave_Iceberg","Iceberg","On success, Choose 1 of the targets, they take {Source d10} damage instead and give them {Source /3} cold.")
B.Wf=new A.v("feature_wave_Surf","Surf","You are also pushed in the same direction then may dash up to {source} in either perpendicular direction.")
B.WN=new A.v("feature_wave_Tsunami","Tsunami","On Success, all enemies adjacent to you are also pushed. The distance of the push is increased by {source}.")
B.acF=s([B.Sc,B.Wf,B.WN],t.U)
B.Zj=new A.ap("feature_wave","Wave","[Action] target all enemies within a {Source}x{Source} box with at least 1 space adjacent to you and Make an Melee Attack vs Str. On success, deal {Source d8} damage and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.\n\n[Reaction] when you or an ally range {Source} succeeds a defense, Spend your reaction, and target all enemies within {Half Source} of the Triggering character. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Str and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.",B.N,B.acF,!1,!0,null,null)
B.U6=new A.v("feature_weapon_attack_Charge","Charge","Before making a Melee Weapon attack, Move up to {2*Source} in a straight line toward the target. If you moved at least 2 spaces, gain a +1 to the attack result.")
B.XV=new A.v("feature_weapon_attack_culling","Culling","When you kill an enemy, You may make an attack with a weapon you are holding dealing {Source d6} extra damage on a Success. The extra culling attack may not trigger a culling attack.")
B.XQ=new A.v("feature_weapon_attack_penetrating","Penetrating","After you Succeed with a weapon attack, the attack ignores damage Resistance and Shield.")
B.Wr=new A.v("feature_weapon_attack_sacrifice","Sacrifice","On Success, you may deal yourself up to {Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance, and increase your damage by the same number of d12.")
B.a9f=s([B.U6,B.XV,B.XQ,B.Wr],t.U)
B.YI=new A.ap("feature_weapon_attack","Weapon Attack","Select a weapon type, size, and technique to define your attack.",B.N,B.a9f,!1,!0,null,null)
B.W3=new A.v("feature_whirlwind_Protector","Protector","On success, you may dash allies in range to free spaces in range. Until the start of your next turn allies in range gain +1 to defenses.")
B.X2=new A.v("feature_whirlwind_Tornado","Tornado","On success, after dealing damage you may dash up to {Half Source} then dash all targets to a free space in range.")
B.XT=new A.v("feature_whirlwind_Storm","Storm","On Success, until the start of your next turn spaces within 2 of you are difficult terrain for enemies and you have a +1 to defenses from ranged attacks.")
B.abh=s([B.W3,B.X2,B.XT],t.U)
B.Y9=new A.ap("feature_whirlwind","Whirlwind","[Action]: Make a Melee attack vs Dex Targeting enemies range 2. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range. \n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on attack or when an ally fails with their action, spend your reaction and target all enemies range 2, and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Dex, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range.",B.N,B.abh,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Uq=new A.v("feature_wreath_of_flames_Bonfire","Bonfire","Increase the range of the status check to {1 + Half Power}.")
B.Vo=new A.v("feature_wreath_of_flames_Living_Inferno","Living Inferno","The target gains {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. If you target an ally, they have {Half Source} d12 regeneration as long as they have this burn.")
B.Tf=new A.v("feature_wreath_of_flames_Thorn_Wreath","Thorn Wreath","Whenever the target fails a melee defense, both the target and the attacker gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. Allies do not gain this burn.")
B.aaC=s([B.Uq,B.Vo,B.Tf],t.U)
B.Zh=new A.ap("feature_wreath_of_flames","Wreath of Flames","[Reaction] During your or an ally turn, Target a creature within 1 space. As long as you are concentrating, whenever an enemy starts their turn within 1 space of the Target, or becomes within 1 space of them for the first time during their turn, make an Status Check Vs Dex. On Success, they gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. The target of the wreath of flame doesn\u2019t trigger the status check.\n\n[Reaction] After you or an ally fails a defense, You may begin concentrating on Wreath of flame targeting the triggering ally. If the triggering defense was from a Melee Attack, give the attacker {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex.",B.aA,B.aaC,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Wp=new A.v("feature_wraith_Drain","Drain","On success, You or the triggering ally gain {Half Source d6} shield.")
B.VV=new A.v("feature_wraith_Rip","Rip","On Success with the reaction, if the triggering attack also succeeds give the target {Source} d6 bleed.")
B.SZ=new A.v("feature_wraith_Torment","Torment","On Success, until the end of your next turn, the target gets a -1 on defense results while within 3 of you.")
B.acq=s([B.Wp,B.VV,B.SZ],t.U)
B.Ym=new A.ap("feature_wraith","Wraith","[Action] Dash {Half Source} then make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting 1 enemy range 3. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and this damage ignores shield and resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally range 6 succeed with a Melee attack during their turn, spend your reaction and Deal {Source/3 d6} damage vs Wis, and this damage and the triggering attack\u2019s damage ignores Shield and Resistance.",B.N,B.acq,!1,!0,null,null)
